      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your point about wealth concentration is well-founded, and critics do argue that without mechanisms to redistribute automated profits—such as UBI or AI dividends—the inequality gap could indeed destabilize societies. Proponents of UBI often highlight its role as an economic shock absorber that prevents total societal collapse when labor disappears, rather than just as a prize for past productivity. However, even strong advocates acknowledge that UBI alone must be paired with infrastructure investment and robust safety nets to truly address the root causes of this potential crisis.",
